# Design system layers

Authoritative: [`docs/design-system-layers.md`](../../docs/design-system-layers.md).
When adding or splitting UI, follow [`.cursor/skills/add-ui-component/SKILL.md`](../skills/add-ui-component/SKILL.md).
When auditing an existing type, follow [`.cursor/skills/evaluate-ui-component/SKILL.md`](../skills/evaluate-ui-component/SKILL.md).

Three layers (Brad Frost). **Stop at the highest layer you need.** Folder layout is **flat** — no `Core` / `Forms` / `Feedback` / `Research` nesting.

| Layer | Where (flat) | Rule |
|---|---|---|
| **Components** | `DesignSystem/Components/PV*.swift` | Content-agnostic; tokens + slots only. |
| **Recipes** | `DesignSystem/Recipes/` | Provenencia-specific, **≥2 call sites**. Thin map onto components. |
| **Snowflakes** | `Features/<Feature>/` or `DesignSystem/Snowflakes/` | One screen. Promote on second real consumer. |

Inside `Components/`: **primitive** vs **composite** is a concept, not a subfolder. Prefer one panel + slots over a new root dialog.

```swift
// ❌ BAD — category nesting, or domain types in Components/
// DesignSystem/Components/Forms/PVInput.swift
// DesignSystem/Components/Research/PVEvidenceIcon.swift

// ✅ GOOD — flat by layer
// DesignSystem/Components/PVInput.swift
// DesignSystem/Recipes/PVEvidenceIcon.swift
```

- Do **not** add new files under legacy `Components/Core|Forms|Feedback|Navigation|Data|Research/`.
- Compose down; don’t clone sideways for a slight variant.
- No dimming/scrim on sheets — window owns chrome (see `PVConfirm` / DesignSystem README).
- Search existing components/recipes before inventing chrome under `Features/`.
